      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Clear the mutation error after refreshing favorites**\n\nWhen an add/remove request fails but the subsequent authoritative favorites request succeeds, `onRefreshFavorites` only refetches the separate query; the mutation remains in `isError` until it is reset or another mutation starts. The card therefore continues showing this error and its \u201cConsultar guardados\u201d action even after the refreshed favorite state is displayed, leaving the recovery flow in a contradictory error state. Reset the mutation after a successful refresh, or derive this alert from refresh completion.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
